["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"132. 对星海图创始人高继扬的3小时访谈：鲶鱼、曾国藩、Waymo与Momenta的两面、一只狼与许华哲的离开 VLA data recipe sim-to-real gap domain transfer NRE 加 License\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-02-13-zhangxiaojun-机器人行业不浪漫-链条太长-人得把头伸到土里/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0f499571a7c864df-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">3:04:52</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0213</span></div>\n<h2>机器人行业不浪漫：链条太长，人得把头伸到土里</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">星海图创始人高继扬说，机器人创业的竞争是六边形：整机、供应链、数据、模型、渠道、终端，算法传播周期只有两三个月，壁垒最小。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">具身智能</span><span class=\"tag\">机器人</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"音乐人张玮玮×罗永浩！我们都是那个“混乱又伟大”的 90 年代的幸存者 after party\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-02-11-cn2d7912-舒适环境里创作不出东西-冲突和差异越大反而越好/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0980c89abd69e75d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"罗\"><span class=\"dur\">5:39:04</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">罗永浩的十字路口</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0211</span></div>\n<h2>舒适环境里创作不出东西，冲突和差异越大反而越好</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">民谣乐手张玮玮回顾从西北厂矿小城到北京地下室排练的十几年：父母离婚、国企崩塌、广州挨饿卖唱、乐队解散，每一次动荡都没把他压垮，反而是后来生活安稳下来才真正写不出东西。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">民谣</span><span class=\"tag\">90年代</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"蒋奇明&amp;双雪涛×罗永浩！如何成为飞行家 Peaky Blinders\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-02-04-cn2d7912-看过深圳年轻人的硬件样机后-罗永浩的悲观被打消了/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/8991b069d150d3a4-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"罗\"><span class=\"dur\">2:34:51</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">罗永浩的十字路口</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0204</span></div>\n<h2>看过深圳年轻人的硬件样机后，罗永浩的悲观被打消了</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">这两年大环境常让罗永浩悲观，但去深圳看了一圈20岁出头的硬件创业者、看到已经打出来的样机后，他相信扎实的工业基础能托住下一代，重新乐观起来。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">东北文艺复兴</span><span class=\"tag\">电影改编</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"131. 印奇出任阶跃星辰董事长的访谈：聪明人的诱惑、取舍、超长链路残酷淘汰赛、阶跃函数和超多元方程 VLA foundation model edge MVP\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-01-26-zhangxiaojun-印奇出任阶跃星辰董事长-基模公司做2b和纯2c都不成立/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ae74dec7a752a3fc-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">2:01:27</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0126</span></div>\n<h2>印奇出任阶跃星辰董事长：基模公司做2B和纯2C都不成立</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">基模一年至少烧30亿人民币、要维持三到五年，所以做2B或纯C端软件都算不过账；阶跃的赌注是基模加终端，用软硬一体换一张上牌桌的资格。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>3</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">大模型</span><span class=\"tag\">商业化</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"130. 张月光创业两年首次访谈：妙鸭不是AI Native产品、流程到上下文设计、One Way Door和乙女游戏 AI Native One Way Door Live2D Context Engineering Q-Time / Save Time\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-01-22-zhangxiaojun-妙鸭不是-ai-native-产品-它只是把-ai-用好的互联网产品/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/84b4403959914648-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">3:14:15</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0122</span></div>\n<h2>妙鸭不是 AI Native 产品：它只是把 AI 用好的互联网产品</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">张月光复盘两年创业：妙鸭靠限制用户自由度换取稳定效果，本质是互联网产品思维；AI Native 产品要换成面向 context 的设计，而单向门产品才是他愿意押上全部身家的东西。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>3</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 产品</span><span class=\"tag\">创业</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"刘震云×罗永浩！有些玩笑含着泪也要开完\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-01-15-cn2d7912-乡村不是没有天才-而是天才没赶上恢复高考/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c5efb79bd917b306-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"罗\"><span class=\"dur\">4:27:47</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">罗永浩的十字路口</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0115</span></div>\n<h2>乡村不是没有天才，而是天才没赶上恢复高考</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">如果不是恢复高考，刘震云现在还在种地；他那位边种地边解微积分的表哥，很可能本该拿物理诺贝尔奖。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">文学创作</span><span class=\"tag\">乡土中国</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"EP1 刘嘉玲说，60岁是她的黄金时代\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-01-13-xiaotianzhang-趁体力还在-刘嘉玲说60到70岁才是她的黄金时代/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2805c831609a7cd9-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"小\"><span class=\"dur\">1:19:52</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">小天章</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0113</span></div>\n<h2>趁体力还在：刘嘉玲说60到70岁才是她的黄金时代</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">她说70岁后体力撑不住旅行与应酬，60到70岁反而是情绪最稳定、最该趁现在去埃及、耶路撒冷这些心愿地的十年。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">衰老心态</span><span class=\"tag\">婚姻相处</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Lovart 创始人陈冕×罗永浩！且让我大闹一场，然后悄然离去 AI native reward model AGI Agent\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-01-09-cn2d7912-ai十年内不会让人类没用-这是陈冕押上全部身家的赌注/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/21e3cf477d7561e6-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"罗\"><span class=\"dur\">3:43:55</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">罗永浩的十字路口</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0109</span></div>\n<h2>AI十年内不会让人类没用：这是陈冕押上全部身家的赌注</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">如果AI十年内学不会人类的品味和判断，像Lovart这样需要人介入的设计产品就还有价值；一旦判断错，公司也会跟着完蛋。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI创业</span><span class=\"tag\">产品策略</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"129. 全球大模型第一股的上市访谈，和智谱CEO张鹏聊：敢问路在何方？ MAS Test Time Scaling VLA\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-01-08-zhangxiaojun-全球大模型第一股上市了-张鹏说中国-ai-没有泡沫/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/96bd8c162ef0083d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">2:26:39</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0108</span></div>\n<h2>全球大模型第一股上市了，张鹏说中国 AI 没有泡沫</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">美国资本市场可能有泡沫，中国不存在——中国投 AI 的钱只有美国的二十几分之一，远远不够。张鹏的逻辑是：离 AGI 还远、钱还不够，就更得投，不投它不会自然发生。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">大模型</span><span class=\"tag\">开源</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"128. Manus决定出售前最后的访谈：啊，这奇幻的2025年漂流啊… compaction awareness Remote Labor Index TIR RLVR latent reasoning\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-12-30-zhangxiaojun-manus-决定出售前最后访谈-ai-没有蛮荒期-因为没新平台/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4744d9a1060b8431-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">3:31:17</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1230</span></div>\n<h2>Manus 决定出售前最后访谈：AI 没有蛮荒期，因为没新平台</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">移动互联网的蛮荒期来自硬件换代，桌面到手机让巨头和个人开发者众生平等；AI 技术突破更大，却没有出现全新平台，所以巨头、创业公司、个人开发者反应一样快，蛮荒期不存在。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>20</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI Agent</span><span class=\"tag\">Manus</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"影石Insta360 创始人刘靖康×罗永浩！比生存更重要的是那些微小的念头 337 Investigation NPE PMF DFM\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-12-25-cn2d7912-硬刚大疆做无人机-他们图的不是打败对手/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/096fe60475239ebc-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"罗\"><span class=\"dur\">4:24:37</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">罗永浩的十字路口</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1225</span></div>\n<h2>硬刚大疆做无人机，他们图的不是打败对手</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">消费级无人机此前几乎全军覆没，他们明知如此仍进场，理由不是抢市场，而是做无人机能一次性把公司的技术、制造、供应链能力拉到新台阶，帮企业穿越下一个周期。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">硬件创业</span><span class=\"tag\">供应链管理</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"127. 大模型季报跨年对谈：和广密预言一场AI War、两大联盟和第三个范式Online Learning Online Learning Agentic Web Neo Labs Credit Assignment\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-12-24-zhangxiaojun-ai不是泡沫-是巨头砸光最后一分钱也不下牌桌的战争/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a70c3ff97f6ae434-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:18:02</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1224</span></div>\n<h2>AI不是泡沫，是巨头砸光最后一分钱也不下牌桌的战争</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">所谓 AI 泡沫，是拿商业回报算出来的账；巨头把它当成新的国防或核武器，算的是被颠覆的风险——所以宁可砸光最后一分钱，也不轻易下牌桌。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">大模型</span><span class=\"tag\">AGI</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"126. 和红杉郑庆生聊：经济史的流量革命、人类行为模式的不可预期，与创始人性格 双边网络效应 PMF 幸存者偏差\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-12-21-zhangxiaojun-ai-时代的网络没有自然垄断-边际成本不趋近于零/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/49045e811e1dea1b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:43:06</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1221</span></div>\n<h2>AI 时代的网络没有自然垄断，边际成本不趋近于零</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">互联网产品是巨大的城镇，边际成本趋近于零所以赢家通吃；AI 每多一个用户就多一份 token 成本，这个差别会改写流量节点的商业设计。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 投资</span><span class=\"tag\">流量</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"导演大鹏×罗永浩！我这两辈子\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-12-17-cn2d7912-大鹏-我好像活了两辈子-上辈子总被保安轰-被粉丝踩/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/225eff6d82f85e3d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"罗\"><span class=\"dur\">5:02:21</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">罗永浩的十字路口</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1217</span></div>\n<h2>大鹏：我好像活了两辈子，上辈子总被保安轰、被粉丝踩</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">大鹏说自己好像活了两辈子：上一辈子他穿短裤在电影节红毯尽头被保安呵斥、在直播现场被粉丝踩在脚底下；这一辈子他走红毯、领奖，迎面喊他名字的还是当年那群记者。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">人物访谈</span><span class=\"tag\">创业者成长</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"125. Freda的投资札记第1集：下注OpenAI、Robinhood往事，美国资本坏小孩、算盘与泡沫 Crossover Scaling Law Single GM Prediction Market Agentic Commerce Neo Labs\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-12-16-zhangxiaojun-openai-的商业模式是负向滚雪球-越烧越亏/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f93330d12f4107e9-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:24:26</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1216</span></div>\n<h2>OpenAI 的商业模式是负向滚雪球，越烧越亏</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">模型公司每年要拿上一年的训练成本乘以十去烧下一代模型，收入却只按上一年的两倍回收，加 2 减 10，现金流年年更负。只有停止烧钱那天，利润表才会突然好看。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">OpenAI</span><span class=\"tag\">Anthropic</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"124. 雨森的创投观察第1集：2026年预期、The Year of R、回调、我们如何下注 Year of R New Labs proactive agent Remote Labor Index OOD\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-12-13-zhangxiaojun-2026-是回报之年-模型没有秘密-应用才有护城河/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/9da6aa992d11d172-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">3:23:03</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1213</span></div>\n<h2>2026 是回报之年：模型没有秘密，应用才有护城河</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">模型能力进步在放缓，中国开源模型把差距压到 6-12 个月，API 生意没有垄断性壁垒；真正值钱的是模型之外那层 context、工具和环境。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 投资</span><span class=\"tag\">模型护城河</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"123. 对ONE2X创始人王冠3小时访谈：生成系统、没有中间商赚差价、内容平台的权力分配 DSL System 1 / System 2 Context Engineering prosumer reward function\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-12-12-zhangxiaojun-ai-时代的公司最终都是生成系统公司-中间商会被干掉/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/892c212740d3e240-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">3:42:54</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1212</span></div>\n<h2>AI 时代的公司最终都是生成系统公司，中间商会被干掉</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">互联网平台靠分配权剥削生产端，同样的内容不同人发量不一样，说明分配机制失效。生成系统把分配内化，直接连接需求和生产，产销合一。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">生成系统</span><span class=\"tag\">数据飞轮</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"MiniMax 创始人闫俊杰×罗永浩！大山并非无法翻越 Scaling Law AGI Exploration/Exploitation MOE OpenRouter\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-12-10-cn2d7912-缩放定律最早在百度被发现-但做出gpt的却是美国公司/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ffd4880abb9af1d0-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"罗\"><span class=\"dur\">3:50:59</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">罗永浩的十字路口</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1210</span></div>\n<h2>缩放定律最早在百度被发现，但做出GPT的却是美国公司</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">MiniMax创始人严俊杰说，奠定大模型根基的缩放定律2014年就已经在百度被发现，但真正做出GPT的却是没有历史包袱的美国创业公司。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">大模型</span><span class=\"tag\">成本结构</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"122. 朱啸虎现实主义故事的第三次连载：人工智能的盛筵与泡泡 Club Deal Dark Fiber SOTA Token\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-12-09-zhangxiaojun-ai-三年内看不到泡沫-但-vc-共识太集中才是真风险/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0b9b598ea05f613e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">48:00</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1209</span></div>\n<h2>AI 三年内看不到泡沫，但 VC 共识太集中才是真风险</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">朱啸虎说泡沫论是二级市场投资人在故意引导回调，真正的问题是一级市场每个项目都成了 Club Deal，GP 赚不了大钱、LP 也不开心。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>3</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 泡沫</span><span class=\"tag\">风险投资</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"121. 对DeepMind谭捷的访谈：机器人、跨本体、世界模型、Gemini Robotics 1.5和Google VLA cross embodiment transfer motion transfer sim to real egocentric video embodiment gap\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-11-28-zhangxiaojun-机器人最大的瓶颈不是算法-是数据/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/946401201b99ef46-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">2:06:15</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1128</span></div>\n<h2>机器人最大的瓶颈不是算法，是数据</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">谭捷在 Google DeepMind 做了十年机器人，他的判断是：机器人基座模型至今还不是独立学科，只是多模态大模型的微调；真正的瓶颈是数据，而摇操采数据不是终局。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">机器人</span><span class=\"tag\">具身智能</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"导演毕赣×罗永浩！清醒、深刻、独一无二的造梦者\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-11-28-cn2d7912-路边野餐开场沉闷不是失误-而是让观众像爬山一样抵达日出/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/e517097b0b03288b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"罗\"><span class=\"dur\">3:20:56</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">罗永浩的十字路口</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1128</span></div>\n<h2>路边野餐开场沉闷不是失误，而是让观众像爬山一样抵达日出</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">毕赣说真正尊重观众，是尊重观众的潜意识而非喜好：前半段的障碍不会被剪掉，因为翻过障碍抵达的震撼，和直接到达完全是两回事。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">长镜头</span><span class=\"tag\">文艺片</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"何同学×罗永浩！青年何同学的骄傲与烦恼 MVP\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-11-20-cn2d7912-何同学海外视频播放破千万-半年youtube收入仅2万美元/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0106480d1afb6af1-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"罗\"><span class=\"dur\">3:30:29</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">罗永浩的十字路口</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1120</span></div>\n<h2>何同学海外视频播放破千万，半年YouTube收入仅2万美元</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">外界曾传闻英文频道靠YouTube分成年入百万到千万，何同学亲口澄清：做了半年总收入只有两万美元，长视频一期也就两三千美元。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">自媒体创业</span><span class=\"tag\">内容选题</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"120. 小鹏新上任的刘先明首次访谈：Language是毒药、拆掉L、简单即美、换帅、小鹏的AI转型 VLA Latent COT scaling Physical AI\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-11-18-zhangxiaojun-小鹏拆掉语言模型-language-是毒药-简单即美/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/1e2c3717dde66c36-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:48:45</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1118</span></div>\n<h2>小鹏拆掉语言模型：Language 是毒药，简单即美</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">小鹏自动驾驶新负责人刘先明把 VLA 里的 Language 拆掉，用 27 万到 30 万小时纯视觉数据直接输出控制信号，因为 Language 是离散的、低效的，会成为数据规模化的瓶颈。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">自动驾驶</span><span class=\"tag\">VLA</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"魔术大师刘谦×罗永浩！你所不知道的刘谦 misdirection Force Crossing Card Force 巴格拉斯效应\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-11-11-cn2d7912-魔术师手速快不是真相-靠的是转移你的注意力/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/e93f477040d6a053-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"罗\"><span class=\"dur\">4:28:01</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">罗永浩的十字路口</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1111</span></div>\n<h2>魔术师手速快不是真相，靠的是转移你的注意力</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">刘谦说「手速快」是魔术师自古编造出来掩盖真相的说法，真正的核心技术是misdirection，把观众的注意力和思维同时引开。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">魔术</span><span class=\"tag\">misdirection</span>\n</div></div></a>"]